        "TileImage": "$($repository cee4e428-1efb-42ef-8eb5-763822781738).Image",
        "Description": "Our client was a Haven guest who was walking down the beach when she suffered an accident and nearly drowned. The guests and staff mocked her for almost drowning in one and a half inches of water.\rShe ended her stay early and left in tears. As payback she wants the targets to walk a mile in her sandals. Let them know that it could happen to anyone 47.",
